<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE CLOSING: TALSE DOWN.</title>
<headline>BOURSE CLOSING: TALSE DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary data from the Estonian bourse on Tuesday showed the Talse index down 1.12 percent to 342.25.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
